  <item>
    <title>宅女的学习app：第一集—欧路字典（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676277287d8426f6920e04e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676277287d8426f6920e04e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是欧路字典上篇，因为字典的使用我觉得有必要介绍一下。所以会在下篇中具体写操 作方法。如果对字典的选择不感兴趣的可以不看。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>引言：推荐依据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>推荐原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> &nbsp;内容设置的简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 欧路字典上半篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>为什么要注意字典的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a>发音篇：</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐词典：三省堂新明解辞典+NHK日本語発音アクセント辞書</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a>新明解辞典的介绍：音调符号、自带发音、发音标准</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9lJ3PablezXypl7xrAbm38JCR6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a>NHK日本語発音アクセント辞書介绍：独特的发音图以及使用方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a>具体示例：懐かしい、なつかしい</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs920NNEtOlPlLNrSzwa9JaGHLIZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 词义篇：比较やま(山)这个词在不同字典中的翻译</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDZmgN6n6nIK1w5qrvZZQf2lCkj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fui5YcPuGh6YL6mwxSrOl225TKUU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a>语法篇：日本语表现文型字典</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a>补充篇：明确需求、</span></p><span></span><p><span>额外推荐字典</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhlQS2hfdKYDYNDvok6pDbuKjKyi.m4a" length="22946294" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:11:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm52qJdQvaer4LrzhYkp5ve7mq6D.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>宅女的奇思妙想1：什么是正确的日语学习法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6752fff2bdb9877a97de2c4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6752fff2bdb9877a97de2c4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一篇有点长，录好了又全部推翻重来一遍，因为电脑中毒把工程文件毁了。结果越录越长。大家可以跳过不感兴趣的部分。我把自己未来的规划大概写了一下。正文部分稍显混乱。因为我第一次尝试不提前写自由发挥，后期的时候把个别不通顺的语句修改掉。所以看着不太有逻辑。其实每次归纳小标题的时候自己也很无语。因为我的思维太跳脱，如果不事先写好稿子可能就会这样无限延伸。对于只想了解自己感兴趣的内容的人而言，稍显不便。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>前言</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>关于播客的总结和未来的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 关于以前的播客的总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a>新的播客规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a>学习的新思维</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;书本学习vs自媒体学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>手机软件的优势&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a>宅女的学习app栏目简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>宅女的学习日记栏目简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a>宅女的奇思妙想栏目简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>正文</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 选择这个题目的初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 日语三问以及我的回答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a></span><em><span>日语学习的一些争议（内容较多所以划分小标题） &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a>自媒体学习时代信息真假难辨</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 日语“好不好学”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a>血脉压制的学习是真的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a>怎么看谐音记忆法?</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 与英语对比发音</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 与中文对比发音</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a>用“注音法”学习日语。</span><em><span>音标=罗马音=拼音</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a>有难度的语法学习以及原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a>日语这么难为什么我不放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll9ELBaDoeH278hpT0KK8aVgOL65.m4a" length="35194870" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:13</itunes:duration>
